<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico daily monetary base figures.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico daily monetary base figures.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico monetary base data as of August 27, except when noted:</p>
<p>Net bank notes and coins in circulation		 57.685 bln</p>
<p>Balance of bank's current accounts with central bank   -19 million</p>
<p>Central bank's liquidity objective for Aug 29		nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Figures in pesos.</p>
<p>--Mexico City newsroom 525 7289559</p>
